<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n88761" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">προσαυξ-άνω</span></b> , and <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">προσαυξ-αύξω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>increase, enhance, promote</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">προσαυξήσασά τινα τοῖς φιλανθρώποις</span>
			<i>honouring</i> him with . . , <i><span class="en">
				Plb.
				32.1.6
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">π. τὴν ἐκείνων ὑπόθεσιν</span>
			<i>confirm</i> it, <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				28.20.6
			</span></i>:— more freq. in 
				Pass.
			, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">προσαύξομαι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hp.
					<u>Vict.</u>
					1.7
				</span></i>
			: pf.
			inf.
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">προσηυξῆσθαι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Thphr.
					<u>HP</u>
					1.8.5
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>CP</u>
				1.9.1
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸ χρυσίον ἐκ τοῦ φορτίου</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Them.
					<u>Or.</u>
					23.286a
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>add</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄλλο . . ἀγαθόν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>SIG</u>
					399.32
				</span></i>
			 (Delph., <span class="entity">iii B.C.</span>):—
				Pass.
			, <i>to be added</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τινι</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Philet.
				3
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> intr. in 
				Act.
			, <i>wax, increase</i>, Vett. Val.<i><span class="en">
				42.2
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				44.9
			</span></i>.</div>
